            "cooked": "<p>[FOR HIRE] Production n8n + AI Agent systems | Error-handled, confidence-routed, audit-trailed</p>\n<p>I build systems that survive real traffic — not happy-path demos.</p>\n<p>• 19 AI/automation systems shipped to production<br>\n• Every system has input validation, confidence-based routing, schema-validated output, global error/dead-letter layer<br>\n• Flagship: connected 6-workflow suite (support + sales + finance + BI + HR + knowledge) → client reports $190K annual impact, built in 2 weeks on self-hosted n8n<br>\n• Results: 45 min → &lt;20 sec support response · ~10 min → 4.3 sec invoices · 60–70% sales workload cut · 3× lead volume in 30 days</p>\n<p>Stack: n8n (self-hosted), Claude / OpenAI / Gemini, LangGraph, PGVector, HubSpot, WhatsApp, Stripe, Slack, Python/Node</p>\n<p>Portfolio + case studies + live walkthrough: <a href=\"http://emmanuelthompson.anchornovahq.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">emmanuelthompson.anchornovahq.com</a><br>\nFixed-price packages or $20–25/hr.</p>\n<p>Available immediately — <strong>40+ hours per week</strong>, working asynchronously in West Africa Time (WAT / UTC+1).</p>\n<p>DM me the process that is eating time or the workflow that keeps breaking. I’ll tell you straight whether I can fix/build it and what it will take.</p>",
